<title>UK: Republic buys EuroDollar for 95 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Republic buys EuroDollar for 95 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Florida billionaire H. Wayne Huizenga's Republic Industries Inc said on Monday it agreed to buy EuroDollar (Holdings) Plc in a recommended bid valuing the car rental firm at about 95.1 million pounds ($150.9 million).</p>
<p>In a statement released here, Republic said it would offer 190 pence per share cash with a loan note alternative for EuroDollar.</p>
</text>
